<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-11-11T06:51:27.880Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 06:51:27 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai security forces killed an insurgent trainer and a suspect in separate Yala operations near the Malaysian border, and another insurgent was killed in a Yala security action close to Malaysia. Cross-border attacks from Myanmar prompted the Thai Air Force to scramble F‑16 fighter jets to the Tak border and led Thailand to place ten border provinces on alert, while authorities prepared evacuation centres for possible refugee flows. In Satun, a roadside bomb injured three students, and two teenagers were detained over the murder of a 51‑year-old man in Phuket. Thailand and Myanmar began talks to address arsenic-tainted rivers, and Mae Sai residents called for action on cross-border water contamination. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNT2t6UFZhUUZNQm9FMF9ZWVBhRVdHVDFNWVlQSjdoUHp6dGp5WWlWOHRTS2M2aU1MaFZWQVdwaUhaU2lMWUtLbFk4bWwwaXl2dDd0TnJ6UUctWGIwaDJab1l5d29WUnNKWjEyeEZhSVI1UFRoUFYxNVZ3RkdSQzlyV3E1bG1lVEtKbXFxVDBhcjl1VTQwcGFxdDBrTy1UbU5qOUhvQ05oeWQzaV9vUlRuUEhDYVZucW4zbkoyd3hXeUlsdDJJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOZlphLXNISS1fbzdYTVFkSE90OWdWd1NtU0lXRW1DclBwaER1UGZ2c0tWMmpfc3M2TjRiSmJhcndZbkxnZUt6bXJwcDg0NFFIajdFazcxa01SZ0JZYXpOdllMWW1jSWZCRTlGUUhYaVdBNFQ3WjN4ZWFISW9RRnpvejRCSmNuVGpJR2VUbUJkQU5ET0MwNms1WXE0Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangkok Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNRjdFb1dab3N4WUM5em5IV2VtZ3J3UnNlSl82RmdFVm5JaXNOend3N0dRazFOd3o2Y1VoS0Y4OXdYWThlYlFDNTFOU3BMZ2tuVXk2YzV1cE5sendfSFcwLWVyTzR4R1ZXNUVMdm5sUTJUdjdRZXVDaU4wSGRpWnRTRGw4cnlHanJvd3lFcngzTzA0Wlg5ZnR3eXVfYVM1V2Z1OEhQbzdYWjNyTjluSE14a25MaWxuMFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Newswav&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV